title: "Huemul genome resources"
abstract: >-
  Bioinformatic scripts documenting the nuclear genome assembly, mitochondrial
  genome assembly, annotation, and comparative/phylogenomic analyses of the
  huemul (Hippocamelus bisulcus), associated with NCBI BioProject PRJNA1509444.
